[{"title":"九月十四日舟由丹徒夜半与薇隐乘月登岸行三里作","author":"王采薇","text":"幽行已三里，村落半摛扉。\n只鸟时依树，孤萤不上衣。\n月高人影小，潮定橹声稀。\n沿水星星火，归惊宿鹭飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26728,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄季逑时客和州","author":"王采薇","text":"空院题诗对碧莎，华年作别叹蹉跎。\n梦馀捲帐人疑在，书去寻愁语转多。\n晓岫入云飞断雁，夜镫照雨落残蛾。\n空江无复怜才客，此夕租船忆啸歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26729,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蒋墅舟次和季逑下第有作","author":"王采薇","text":"一夕霜花湿鬓青，湍声出渚棹初停。\n病中龙具和衣泣，愁里鱼箫带梦听。\n隔浦叶多飞似鸟，入林镫小远于星。\n从君湖海幽寻志，何日浮家去杳冥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26730,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春夕","author":"王采薇","text":"已罢雠书怨夕遥，更闻疏竹度邻箫。\n灵珑鸟语惊帘押，寂寞香丝绕画绡。\n一院露光团作雨，四山花影下如潮。\n伤离不为何郎句，病久东阳自损腰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26731,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"何玉瑛","text":"覆巢无完卵，肉味安赖知。\n此语达而痛，乃出七龄儿。\n闻变弈不动，临刑甘如饴。\n具此浩然气，巾帼胜须眉。\n假令得永年，岂数女中师。\n痛哉孔文举，身后无孑遗。\n裂眦数阿瞒，惨戮一何悲。\n此女甘荼毒，空赎蔡文姬。\n王霸厉清操，胡惭令狐友。\n儿女俗情牵，嗫嚅愧其妇。\n当其偃卧时，理欲交战久。\n室谪傥有词，北门恐失守。\n虽贵岂如高，一语醍灌首。\n古来孟光贤，梁鸿甘杵臼。\n似此灌园终，毋乃闺中诱。\n惜哉逸姓名，高风真不朽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26732,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口占勖儿","author":"何玉瑛","text":"殖学精于勤，取法贵乎上。\n功无一息宽，志欲千古抗。\n临渴而掘井，及泉乌可望。\n置身贤豪间，男儿何多让。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26733,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景","author":"何玉瑛","text":"树杪点霏霏，蹁跹燕子飞。\n数声啼鸟寂，一缕篆烟微。\n竹笋掀泥出，梨花带雨肥。\n眼前饶好景，得句愧珠玑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26734,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盼竹友舅氏滇中信","author":"何玉瑛","text":"一诺重千金，招魂瘴岭阴。\n老人虽健饭，闺梦总关心。\n义胆神灵护，征途雨雪侵。\n此时回棹未，旦晚盼鸿音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26735,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"松涛","author":"何玉瑛","text":"轮囷老干郁千寻，万籁销沈听远音。\n风雨五更惊鹤梦，波涛一院起龙吟。\n檐前水讶倾银汉，空外声还答暮砧。\n雨滴芭蕉风戛竹，一般幽韵谱瑶琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26736,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"截竹为小洞箫吹之合律喜而赋此","author":"何玉瑛","text":"琴书馀暇学吹筒，拣得良材制造工。\n羡汝瘦生偏直节，可人爽籁本虚中。\n松间滴沥萧疏雨，空外悠扬婀娜风。\n清响原来需小凤，镜台长伴当栖桐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26737,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄远","author":"何玉瑛","text":"暂同蠖屈亦何悲，风雨终看破壁时。\n儒者治生原急务，古人随地有师资。\n关心眠食期加饭，得意溪山乞好诗。\n来往鲤鱼烦尺素，流光弹指数归期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26738,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游小蓬莱山","author":"何玉瑛","text":"满径白云冷，数株风树斜。\n此中有仙女，愿与乞胡麻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26739,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扫梅","author":"何玉瑛","text":"梅花片片白无瑕，吹落阶前雪点斜。\n未忍和苔黏履迹，月明携帚扫瑶华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26740,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闺中读书","author":"何玉瑛","text":"文采翩翩亦未宜，大家遗训恰须知。\n古来列女非无传，不在多闻在取资。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26741,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慰母","author":"刘希班","text":"大义千年重，浮生一粒轻。\n留儿贞节在，儿死胜儿生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26742,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚行过昭山","author":"方芬","text":"长沙西去水驿长，季冬不觉江风凉。\n昭山对面挹秀色，龙口飞渡波茫茫。\n斜阳缥缈入林去，岸风吹送梅花香。\n山头古寺鸣钟起，噌吰镗鞳和鸣榔。\n松声摵摵复入耳，须臾明月浮清光。\n眼前景物动吟兴，千态万变非寻常。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26743,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阻风敬步伯父原韵","author":"方芬","text":"大风彻夜舞狂漪，正是扁舟系缆时。\n两岸霜枫萦远梦，一帆寒雨乱乡思。\n江间白浪青山动，天外黄云画角吹。\n寄语石尤须早息，扬舲稳渡莫教迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26744,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南行见竹","author":"方芬","text":"山前忽见千竿竹，高影猗猗最可人。\n自别此君双眼俗，相逢为我涤征尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26745,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋","author":"思柏","text":"气爽凉初至，更阑暑渐清。\n秋窗闻雁早，梧叶随风轻。\n野静蛩相语，天高月自明。\n烦蒸从此涤，披卷惬幽情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26746,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"思柏","text":"渺渺天河风浪多，一年一会尚蹉跎。\n人间更有黄泉别，鹊去桥空可奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26747,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画双松歌","author":"廖云锦","text":"画鳞难画龙，画树难画松。\n龙乃神物善变化，几人曾见破壁来虚空？\n松之视龙势不异，离奇蟠曲难形容。\n谁摹此图真妙手，双松矫矫如双龙。\n爪破白日拿云雨，咫尺庭阴青万重。\n祖枝孙干相追逐，生怕茅屋摇秋风。\n朅来移挂傍几榻，猛然惊醒午梦浓。\n绕阶而走心胆落，满庭云气生窗栊。\n日暮萧斋兀愁坐，夜梦已到扶桑东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26748,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜高平表妹至","author":"廖云锦","text":"尔我襟期喜共知，笑言频到漏残时。\n开奁会看将完绣，剪烛閒敲未定诗。\n金鸭灰深香篆袖，晶帘风定落花迟。\n晚来又恐轻言别，月底镫前系梦思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26749,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"端午村居","author":"张芬","text":"荒村无竞渡，极目野烟昏。\n欲奠盈樽酒，空悲绕膝恩。\n五丝难续命，一赋独招魂。\n何以酬佳节，菖蒲绿映门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26750,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋草","author":"张芬","text":"一片凄迷乱鬼磷，断肠休问昔如茵。\n王孙已破天涯梦，游女还伤陌上春。\n野岸带烟昏晓月，暗蛩和雨絮愁人。\n谁寻幽径寒林下，吊古空悲萧瑟辰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26751,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽燕","author":"张芬","text":"越海还山愿已违，隔帘娇语是耶非？\n好凭钗影传遗照，独伴花魂葬石矶。\n一垒香泥閒画楝，几宵春梦别乌衣。\n可怜吟客斜阳里，泪墨盈笺招不归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26752,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕咏","author":"张芬","text":"晚凉无复旧时妆，欲罢金棱益自伤。\n莫笑离多偏易别，久时离别作寻常。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26753,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和皎如沈妹见怀元韵","author":"张芬","text":"香消红袖晚妆残，月下怀下倚曲栏。\n想得吟情幽绝处，满庭风露玉钗寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26754,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀寂居禅友","author":"张芬","text":"楼空愁思迥，凭眺独萧森。\n月镜开灵觉，霜钟警道心。\n可怜黄叶落，无奈白云深。\n想得安禅处，天花正满林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26755,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白杨花和碧云王妹作","author":"张芬","text":"柳絮飞来风片斜，牵人魂梦散梨花。\n淡烟明月迷隋苑，玉燕珠帘忆谢家。\n莺舌好翻新乐府，蛾眉消却旧韶华。\n绵绵欲断浑难断，万缕离情怨暮笳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26756,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读骚","author":"沈纕","text":"江水流不息，落日秋风劲。\n渔父诚知言，千载悲独醒。\n琼佩终不渝，芬芳自辉映。\n微词莫能显，感物托其性。\n风诗固一变，声哀义弥正。\n愿鼓湘灵瑟，高歌发清听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26757,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂兴和林屋山人作 其一","author":"沈纕","text":"一夜响春泉，微雨湿茅屋。\n驱犊出门去，平畴霭如沐。\n禾黍自怀新，生意何彧彧。\n昨停桔槔声，无人雀争啄。\n阳和共歆羡，远风转湿燠。\n黾勉事芸锄，有年从此卜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26758,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂兴和林屋山人作 其二","author":"沈纕","text":"向晚群动息，杖策来东菑。\n邻舍多好怀，往还无厌时。\n平生守直道，讵假智虑为。\n辞拙意弥真，礼疏情不移。\n古风转淳朴，徒为薄俗嗤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26759,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂兴和林屋山人作 其三","author":"沈纕","text":"东风昨夜来，不知草木长。\n晓起荷锄出，眺此平原广。\n墙头桑叶白，屋后春泉响。\n节序时迭更，风光正骀荡。\n野老散鸡豚，相逢时倚杖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26760,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂兴和林屋山人作 其四","author":"沈纕","text":"穹窒竞熏鼠，岁晚百务閒。\n踪迹远城市，陶然西畴间。\n新酒可介寿，园蔬供夕餐。\n不惜三时勤，获此终岁安。\n贫贱瘁筋力，貌苦心亦欢。\n衣食幸自周，苟免饥与寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26761,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨太真华清宫上马图","author":"沈纕","text":"野鹿衔花宫禁悄，沈香侍宴归来早。\n念奴报道宿醒消，果下名驹鞲初好。\n春风扶困上雕鞍，娉婷仙骨何珊珊。\n杏子裙遮金埒暖，鸳纹袖笼玉鞭寒。\n香尘暗逐飞花外，半响鸾铃摇月佩。\n邀得君王带笑看，生怜冠绝风流队。\n那知铁骑起渔阳，鼙鼓惊残歌舞场。\n无奈六军皆不发，马前宛转殉红妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26762,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"方正学画竹赞心斋先生家藏","author":"沈纕","text":"方先生，性正直。\n靖国难，躬戮力。\n族不辞，死何惜？\n剖吾心，割吾舌。\n身可烹，心难折。\n炳今古，耀史册。\n展画竹，泪痕湿。\n两三竿，五六尺。\n挺贞姿，效贞节，疏乔枝，翻密叶，岁寒松，同春柏，起英风，凌霜雪。\n顾此君，人悲切。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26763,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独夜闻笛怀清溪伯姊","author":"沈纕","text":"秋色淡如斯，谁家玉笛吹。\n一声人静后，千里月明时。\n莫辨《关山》曲，空悲《杨柳枝》。\n秋风如可托，为我寄相思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26764,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阻风黄浦和孟韩韵","author":"沈纕","text":"帆影落波光，迢迢水一方。\n潮声飞雨白，风色挟沙黄。\n海月生蓬岛，江蓠裛楚裳。\n骚人无限意，高咏独苍茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26765,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋寺和碧岑姊韵","author":"沈纕","text":"秋寺寒烟湿，支筇望不迷。\n石林残雨响，樵径乱云底。\n落叶埋人迹，疏钟送马蹄。\n我来参大乘，斜日下招提。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26766,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采莲曲同婉兮姊作 其一","author":"沈纕","text":"红蕖十里晓风凉，露滴侬家翠袖香。\n桥畔盈盈双髻女，隔溪相唤渡横塘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26767,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采莲曲同婉兮姊作 其二","author":"沈纕","text":"小立新凉掠鬓丝，画楼吹罢玉参差。\n红衣堕处无人见，月白风清子夜时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26768,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵承旨画兰","author":"沈纕","text":"可怜王者香零落，憔悴潇湘第一枝。\n空向新朝夸画笔，难为骚客写愁思。\n故宫落日悲荆棘，周道秋风怨《黍离》。\n何处托根犹故土，淡烟细雨伴江蓠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26769,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书中乾蝴蝶","author":"沈纕","text":"此身未肯没蓬蒿，翰墨钻研志趣高。\n早并虫鱼登《尔雅》，自寻香草到《离骚》。\n怜他金粉耽缃帙，写尔芳魂托彩毫。\n一卷《南华》凭梦醒，始知栩栩亦徒劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26770,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题二乔观兵书图","author":"沈纕","text":"舳舻焚尽仗东风，应借奇谋闺阁中。\n曾把韬钤问夫婿，谁言儿女不英雄。\n阴符偷读妨描黛，绣帙双开见唾绒。\n一十三篇劳指授，蟂矶馀烈本吴宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26771,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送秋平赴试","author":"张因","text":"落叶满阶砌，西风鸣纸窗。\n晓起促行色，相对两茫茫。\n虽无久离别，中心自感伤。\n何如百里妇，扊扅炊高粮。\n朝餐浑未备，枵腹赴征航。\n细雨湿行袂，凉飙吹短装。\n饥鸿唳天表，寒鹜下林塘。\n行李太单薄，何以御严霜。\n执手斯须立，有泪已盈眶。\n丈夫富经术，忧患天所尝。\n行矣勿复顾，努力事明扬。\n秃笔吐异彩，古墨发新香。\n不挟兔园册，惟凭胸所藏。\n幸逢冰作鉴，慎勿轻文章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26772,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"张因","text":"凉风送远钟，露湿桐阴薄。\n斜月影沈西，卧见榆花落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26773,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题河鲤登龙门图","author":"张因","text":"懵腾斗室摇长风，壁间锦鳞思成龙。\n扬波鼓鬣河当中，头角未具鳞甲雄。\n龙门万仞摩苍穹，纵生八翼层云封。\n欲跳不跳喧丰隆，我见为之心忡忡，鳞兮鳞兮开鸿濛，超然一跃如飞虹。\n雷火烧尾五云从，万里青霄路忽通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26774,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日湖上偶题","author":"张因","text":"湖上春光丽，风微日正和。\n蝶随芳草集，柳近画楼多。\n莺啭疑丝竹，花香散绮罗。\n谁能掳彩笔，写出好烟波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26775,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"衰柳","author":"张因","text":"摇落无心问化工，秋山秋水怨何穷。\n黄眉惨淡愁逢雨，青眼飘零泣向风。\n剩得寒蝉鸣古岸，更无残月照离宫。\n断魂草趁羌人管，又逐清商入远空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26776,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏庭前绿梅 其一","author":"张因","text":"半放犹含意态殊，迷离香梦仗春扶。\n月明偶揭湘帘看，不是红儿是绿珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26777,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏庭前绿梅 其二","author":"张因","text":"疑花疑叶总难分，晴色梢头剪碧云。\n最是晚来易惆怅，数枝无语立斜曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26778,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题江碧岑女史龙女抱经图 其一","author":"张因","text":"珠帘不卷坐焚香，小字维摩病合当。\n要识多才天亦忌，莲台只合拜医王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26779,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题江碧岑女史龙女抱经图 其二","author":"张因","text":"已归净土结莲胎，更向尘寰见异才。\n读尽儒书千万卷，又从佛座授经来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26780,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题自画红梅","author":"朱满娘","text":"一枝红绽傍墙阴，疑是绛衣仙子临。\n莫说桃花偏命薄，多缘霜雪未能禁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26781,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"记得","author":"方婉仪","text":"记得当时拢髻年，春宵坐月百花前。\n谢家小妹王家姊，手弄窥窗白玉钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26782,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题马守贞双钩兰花卷","author":"方婉仪","text":"楚畹幽兰冠众芳，双钩画法异寻常。\n国香流落空留赏，太息金陵马四娘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26783,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"期诸娣姒茶话","author":"方婉仪","text":"旧家门巷草新生，岁岁春风不世情。\n已办月团三百片，好为同听煮茶声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26784,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生日偶吟 其一","author":"方婉仪","text":"平簟疏帘小阁晴，朝来池畔最关情。\n清清不染淤泥水，我与荷花同日生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26785,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生日偶吟 其二","author":"方婉仪","text":"梅摹魏国夫人画，字仿杨家妹子书。\n一盏真茶消永昼，玉浆犀液较何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26786,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵题明妃图","author":"方婉仪","text":"冢畔青青草色稠，芳名史册著千秋。\n画师若把黄金嘱，老守长门到白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26787,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归来草堂有感","author":"吴蕙","text":"寂寞空庭冷，凄凉旧迹存。\n乾坤埋傲骨，风雨吊游魂。\n翠色滋阶草，苔痕封树根。\n秋风肃户牖，独立向谁论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26788,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日寄怀蓼洲弟","author":"吴蕙","text":"一夜砧声枫树凋，离亭风雨欲魂消。\n便鸿南向应无数，好寄新诗慰寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26789,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观沈氏诸姬演剧","author":"屠茝佩","text":"梨园喜见属红妆，三五娉婷出洞房。\n檀口莺声歌细细，柳枝蝶态舞将将。\n冠簪雅步参军度，粉墨涂颜伧父行。\n底事酒阑人未散，月明照彻锦云裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26790,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"勉儿勤学","author":"佟素衡","text":"庭槐渐觉影婆娑，岁月催人老奈何。\n昼永尔宜勤课读，夜深余亦爱吟哦。\n从来自恃闻偏浅，到处心虑识愈多。\n美玉琢磨终作器，分阴须惜莫蹉跎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26791,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏古","author":"施坤","text":"仗剑出昭关，投吴秉节钺。\n一出败荆师，再起复全越。\n英风震五湖，霸图日突兀。\n奈何长寇雠，忠言不能入。\n君王赐属镂，臣罪当诛灭。\n鸱夷江水寒，天地泣壮烈。\n转眼问吴宫，繁华久歇绝。\n青青馆娃柳，泠泠苏台月。\n长啸海天空，凉飙振林樾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26792,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏残牡丹","author":"施坤","text":"东风吹老碧桃枝，偏尔能开倾国姿。\n垂首似含亭北恨，折腰如怨马嵬时。\n残香尚足惊丹卉，剩粉犹堪入品题。\n寄语东君好珍重，莫教风雨葬西施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":26793,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]